  "description": "Upgrade your Ford F-150 with a lockable truck bed storage box designed for security, convenience, and space efficiency. Compatible with 2015–2025 driver-side models, it offers a 180° swing-out design, durable waterproof construction, and double-lock protection to keep your gear organized and safe on every journey.\nFeatures\nPrecision Fit for 2015–2025 Ford F-150 Driver Side: Engineered using precise measurements to match the contours of the F-150's Driver-side bed wall. Ensures stable, rattle-free installation without drilling, preserving your truck's factory condition.\nHassle-Free Installation with Included Hardware: Comes complete with mounting brackets, bolts, and a detailed step-by-step manual. Requires only an adjustable spanner and basic hand tools, allowing a single person to complete the setup in under 20 minutes.\nSpace-Efficient 180° Swing-Out Design: Mounted over the wheel well, the storage box rotates 180° outward for immediate access to your gear, then folds back flush against the bed wall to free up cargo space for larger loads. Ideal for daily use and long trips.\nHeavy-Duty, Weather-Resistant Construction: Built from high-grade polypropylene (PP) for a perfect balance of strength and light weight. Resistant to impact, water, and moisture, while its smooth surface makes cleaning quick and effortless. Designed to withstand extreme temperatures and harsh road conditions.\nDual-Layer Anti-Theft Security: Features a built-in self-locking lid to secure stored items, paired with a precision combination padlock that locks the mounting bracket for added protection. Keeps valuable tools and equipment safe from theft in any environment.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended\nFitment\nFit for 2015-2026 Ford F150 Driver Side.\nFor right-side (Driver-side) installation only.\nDoes not affect tailgate opening or tonneau cover operation.\nNot suitable for modified or non-factory-sized cargo boxes.\nSome models with spray-on or plastic bedliners may require appropriate adjustment of the mounting bracket.",
